#: email.cpp:85
msgid "KDE Email Control Module"
msgstr "KDE'neñ Email İdärä Modulı"

#: email.cpp:86
msgid "Configure your identity, email addresses, mail servers, etc."
msgstr "İsemeñne, email adreslarnı, xat serverlärne w.b. caylaw."

#: email.cpp:88
msgid "Current maintainer"
msgstr "Xäzerge qatnaşuçı"

#: email.cpp:191
msgid "New Email Profile"
msgstr "Yaña Email Caybireme"

#: email.cpp:198
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "İsem:"

#: email.cpp:219
msgid "Please enter a name for the profile."
msgstr "Caybirem adın kertäse bar."

#: email.cpp:221
msgid "This email profile already exists, and cannot be created again."
msgstr "Andí email caybireme bar inde, anı qabar yasap bulmí."

#: email.cpp:295
msgid "<h1>Email</h1> This module allows you to enter basic email information for the current user. The information here is used, among other things, for sending bug reports to the KDE developers when you use the bug report dialog.<p> Note that email programs like KMail offer many more features, but they provide their own configuration facilities."
msgstr "<h1>Email</h1> Ağımdağı qullanuçı öçen email turında belem bu modul aşa tutırıp bula. Bet yomğağın cibärgändä dä şul uq email qullanılğan bulaçaq.<p> Beleşmä: KMail kebek email yazılımnarda eşli alu ısulları tağın da kübräk, läkin alarnıñ caylawları da üzeneke."

#: email.cpp:314
msgid "Do you wish to discard changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Biredäge caybiremgä kertelgän üzgäreşlärne yuğaltasımı?"

#: email.cpp:315
msgid "Do you wish to save changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Biredäge caybiremgä kertelgän üzgäreşlärne saqlísı kiläme?"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "User Information"
msgstr "Qullanuçı Turında"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "You can set a reply address if you want replies to your email messages to go to a different address than the email address above. Most likely, you should leave the reply address blank, so replies go to the email address you entered above.<p><em> Please note:</em> <ul><li>You do not need to enter the same email address as above.</li><li>You should not use a reply address if you frequently use discussion mailing lists.</li></ul>"
msgstr "Cawap qaytarası adres töp adres belän ber bulmasa anı bonda kertäse. Küp oçraqlarda bonda berni dä kertäse tügel, ul çaqta cawaplar östä äytelgän adres buyınça qaytaçaq.<p><em> İstä totası:</em> <ul><li>Östäge adres belän ber ük bulğanın kertäse tügel.</li><li>Künderü tezmälärenä yış yazğanda qaytaru adresen kertmäskä.</li></ul>"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"Enter your email address here, e.g. \"john@doe.com\" (without the quotation marks). This information is mandatory if you want to use email.<p>\n"
"Do <em>not</em> enter something like John Doe &lt;john@doe.com&gt;\", just a plain email address. Your email address must not contain any blank spaces."
msgstr ""
"Bonda email adresen kertäse, ü.ö. \"azat@xat.ta\" (özek cäyälären östämiçä). Email qullanası kilsä, bonısız bulmí.<p>\n"
"Bonda \"Azat Borna &lt;john@doe.com&gt;\" kebek närsälär kertäse <em>tügel</em>, email'nıñ qorı adresen genä. Anıñ eçendä buşlıq bilgeläre bula almí."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Organi&zation:"
msgstr "&Oyışma:"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Reply-&to address:"
msgstr "Qaytar&tu adrese:"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "Here you can enter the name of your organization, company or university. This field is <em>optional</em>. However, if you are using a business account and communicate with persons working for other companies, providing the name of your organization is recommended."
msgstr "Üz oyışma, şerkät, üniversitet turında <em>östämä</em> yazmalarnı bonda kertep bula. Üz yä başqa oyışma keşeläre belän aralaşqan çaqta üz eşläw oyışması turında yazmalarnı tutırırğa kiñäş itelä."

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "E&mail address:"
msgstr "E&mail adres:"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Enter your full name here, e.g. \"John Doe\" (without the quotation\n"
"marks). Some people like to provide a nickname only. You can leave this field blank and still use email. However, providing your full name is <em>recommended</em> as this makes it much easier for your recipient to browse his or her email."
msgstr ""
"Üz adın tulı itep kertäse, ü.ö. \"Azat Borna\" (özek cäyälären östämiçä).\n"
"Qayber keşelär üz atamasın ğın kertälär. Bu qırnı buş kileş tä qaldırıp bula, ul çaqta email adrese genä qullanılaçaq. Alay bulsa da, üz tulı adın kertü <em>kiñäş itelä</em>, çönki xat aluçı keşelärgä kilgän xatlar arasında ezläw ul çaqta ciñelräk bulaçaq."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Full &name:"
msgstr "Tulı &isem:"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "SMTP server:"
msgstr "SMTP server:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<qt>You can specify the server to send mail to here.\n"
"<br><br> SMTP means Simple Mail Transfer Protocol and is the standard way to send mail.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Xat yünältü serveren bonda kertäse.\n"
"<br><br>SMTP qısqartması \"Simple Mail Transfer Protocol\" añlatıp, xat cibärü öçen töp bulıp sanalğan protokol.</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "C&urrent profile:"
msgstr "&Biredäge caybirem:"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "&New Profile..."
msgstr "&Yaña Şäxes..."
